  "description": "While working overseas, career woman Kang Min crosses paths with a charming Japanese man, Shibasaki Ken, during a chance encounter on the street. What was meant to be a one-night fling takes an unexpected turn when she runs into him again the next day—this time, at her workplace. This story explores the sweet, messy aftermath of a night that was supposed to mean nothing.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
